[[Open This|Balance Your Cloud Portfolio]]

---

<span style="color: #db89c8;">Balance your cloud portfolio</span> by considering short-term and long-term outcomes as well as low-risk (proven) and higher-risk (experimental) opportunities.

Include migration, modernization, and innovation initiatives, and consider financial benefits (lower costs and/or increased revenue) as well as non-financial benefits (for example, improved customer and employee experience). 